<img src="20170323_122418.jpg" />
<img src="20170323_122441.jpg" />

<p>It was an exquisite day, perfect for the trip. But eventually it was time to head back. I spotted these pelicans on a dock we passed.</p>
<img src="20170323_133232.jpg" />

<p>Back on the boat, Dominic continued his crawling and climbing lessons.</p>
<img src="20170323_133429.jpg" />

<p>Gianna, on the other hand, was <i>pooped.</i></p>
<img src="20170323_133430.jpg" />

<p>At home, Dominic still had enough energy to play with the boat whistle his mommy had just bought. But not for long.</p>
